title: "Incendios_PY: a reproducible computational framework for decoupled wildfire ignition and propagation benchmarking in the Gran Chaco"
abstract: "Open-source pipeline for daily 1-km wildfire ignition and propagation modelling, including D2 target construction, monotonic Platt calibration, M2 fallback, spatial block validation, and FWI/INPE benchmarking."
